    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file for translating text, I need to choose a concrete external provider for translation. I will use the Amazon Translate service, which is a neural machine translation service provided by AWS. The provider will be identifiable by the import of the boto3 library and the use of the 'translate' service client. </thinking>\n",
